{
  "label": "sanadorm40",
  "title_zh": "",
  "lines": [
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "label sanadorm40:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene sanawalkedhome1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/sanawalkedhome1.webp",
      "alt": "sanawalkedhome1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Um...thanks again for...walking all the way here with me, Sensei...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I feel a little bad that...you didn’t even get to have a drink first...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You can just make it up to me by giving me free beer for the next month. That seems fair to me.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The price for...hanging out with you is pretty high...huh?",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Supply and demand, Sana. Supply and demand.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I’m surprised the two of us made it all the way up here without her giving the signal that it was time for me to leave.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Here I was, ready to tuck my hands into my pockets and rush over to the closest convenience store for a hot beverage, but-",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Somehow or another, I’m outside of Sana’s dorm.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well there...sure is a lot of demand for you, so...I guess I understand...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Can I...umm...ask you something, though?",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Is it another pricing question? Because I might need to have you call my secretary if it is.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s not a...pricing question...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I just wanted to ask if you could...keep all of that stuff about my mom a secret...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene sanawalkedhome2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/sanawalkedhome2.webp",
      "alt": "sanawalkedhome2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Of course. It’s not like I’d come out and just tell someone, “Hey. Sana’s mom is in denial about the death of her son. Pass it on.”",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m more worried about you...saying something about it to her...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And then what? Watch her break down in front of me and not know how to handle it?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m by no means a good person, but it’s not like I’m evil, Sana.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene sanawalkedhome3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/sanawalkedhome3.webp",
      "alt": "sanawalkedhome3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Then it...shouldn’t be an issue for you to promise me, right?",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’ve compared you to a...dad a few times tonight, but...you aren’t family...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So you shouldn’t really get involved...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Are you saying you want to live in denial as well, then?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene sanawalkedhome4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/sanawalkedhome4.webp",
      "alt": "sanawalkedhome4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m not denying anything...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": My big brother died and...part of me died with him.",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But the part that’s left needs to stay intact so...my mom can stay sane.",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Crazy to think that just the other day, your big breakthrough moment was confessing that you suddenly wanted to learn karate.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene sanawalkedhome5",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/sanawalkedhome5.webp",
      "alt": "sanawalkedhome5"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": H-Hey! Th-that was...probably even harder to come out and say than...all of this...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It would be weird if...everyone I know kept getting closer to you and I stayed...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": On the inside of a triangle?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene sanawalkedhome6",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/sanawalkedhome6.webp",
      "alt": "sanawalkedhome6"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That’s...actually a really good way of wording it...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Thanks. I thought it up on the way over.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene sanawalkedhome7",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/sanawalkedhome7.webp",
      "alt": "sanawalkedhome7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hah...all I kept thinking of was...how weird it felt walking around with you and...how tall you are...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene sanawalkedhome1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/sanawalkedhome1.webp",
      "alt": "sanawalkedhome1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": B-But...yes...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m on the...inside of a triangle...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And I...told myself that I’ll start being more honest with you...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And what better place to do that than karate lessons?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene sanawalkedhome8",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/sanawalkedhome8.webp",
      "alt": "sanawalkedhome8"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Stop bringing up karate lessons!",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And...and stop bringing up spaghetti!",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I didn’t even mention spaghetti.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You were going to! You have the...spaghetti look in your eyes!",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene sanawalkedhome9",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/sanawalkedhome9.webp",
      "alt": "sanawalkedhome9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Pfft...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What am I...even saying right now?",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "It’s peculiar what jealousy can do to a person.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Between the Christmas party and now...and even before that, Sana and I never really had a dramatic shift in our dynamic.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "She’s always just...been there being cute and...doing cute things, but-",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "We’re actually getting somewhere now.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Maybe I don’t just want to protect her? (And obviously have sex with her because...come on. I'm only human.)",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "But maybe I want to learn about her?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Maybe I want to watch her...try and fail?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "To learn from her mistakes-",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Maybe even succeed sometimes-",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "And to keep nervously smiling at me like I expect her to any moment now.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene sanawalkedhome10",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/sanawalkedhome10.webp",
      "alt": "sanawalkedhome10"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Are you...um...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Are you...cold?",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Right on cue.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Of course. It’s freezing out.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why do you ask?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well, you...walked the whole way here, so...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": If you want to...come warm up inside my room for a little while...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That’s...that’s okay...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Holy crap, am I actually being invited in?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "It’s way later than I’m usually here.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Is she really okay with this?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "What has happened to my precious, reserved little Sana?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You do realize how this sounds, right?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I...have no idea what you’re talking about...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But, um...Ayane isn’t home tonight and...it’s easier to talk about stuff when we’re...in a private room...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Do you really not realize how this sounds?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I told you...I...I have no idea what you’re talking about...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I just...don’t really want you to go home yet...or something...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": When you say it like that, how could I possibly refuse?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene sanawalkedhome11",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/sanawalkedhome11.webp",
      "alt": "sanawalkedhome11"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": R...Really?",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I mean...I always knew you were going to say yes because...you’re a very...sketchy person...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But it’s...still nice...actually hearing it.",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Okay, you’re still new to this, so I won’t be too harsh. But you don’t normally insult someone immediately after inviting them inside.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene sanawalkedhome9",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/sanawalkedhome9.webp",
      "alt": "sanawalkedhome9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Heheh...it wasn’t meant as an insult...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I...like how unpredictable you are...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It makes me...do things outside of my comfort zone...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s...nice having someone like that again...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene black",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/black.png",
      "alt": "black"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Sana opens the door and steps aside, lightly bowing to me and allowing me to walk in first.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Technically, I’m probably the one who should be doing that for her-",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "But since she offered, I’m obviously going to walk in.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Otherwise we’d just have two people standing around in the hallway and looking even more suspicious than we already were with our one-foot height gap.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh, Sana! You’re home!",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I texted you and you didn’t respond, but I decided to-",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene sanawalkedhome12",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/sanawalkedhome12.webp",
      "alt": "sanawalkedhome12"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Stay home tonight...",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": O-Oh! I’m...sorry...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": My...umm...my phone died on the way home...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What are you doing here so late?",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And why are you two together?",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I walked Sana home from work.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You walked...all the way from the bar with her?",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I did.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You didn't just run into her on your way somewhere else?",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I...did not.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Sana nervously closes the door and takes a step toward Ayane with great hesitation.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene sanawalkedhome13",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/sanawalkedhome13.webp",
      "alt": "sanawalkedhome13"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Um...Ayane...it was me who...asked him to t-take me home...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And you invited him into the room as well?",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Y-Yeah...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Even though it’s getting close to midnight and you knew I wasn’t going to be home?",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well...it was cold out...so...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I thought he could...warm up...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene sanawalkedhome14",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/sanawalkedhome14.webp",
      "alt": "sanawalkedhome14"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Do you need to warm up, Sensei?",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You’ve been in my bed several times before, so you know how warm it can get when you hide under the covers.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Ayane...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "else:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No. Stay away from me. If you touch me, I will scream.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
